ZURU – MAX GARDEN 2 LONG FLOWERS, Bring colour and fun to your home with MAX Premium Flowers. Collect 10 elegant flower stem designs for you to build and display as a beautiful bouquet. Designed for ages 8+ years. Each capsule contains up to 243 pieces to build 2 intricate flower stems.
What will make up your ultimate bouquet ? Collect them all !
There are 5 different capsules with 10 different flowers to collect.:
• Lily & Matthiola Incana (243 Pcs);
• Persicaria & Iris (237 Pcs);
• Platycodon & Sunflower (212 Pcs);
• Common Daisy & Lavender (232 Pcs);
• Rose & Lily of the Valley (204 Pcs);
